            "review_title": "Review at Camellia - Flower, Tea & Cake",
            "review_text": "Anthony Nguyen\n4 contributions\n0\nMUST TRY Cafe in town - very close to the Train station\nMay 2019 • Couples\nI went to the Café in May 2019. Location is good as it is very close to the train station. I heard that the shop was opened in April - just a month ago so every was very new and fresh.\n\nI'm the fan of durian, so I chose Durian Cheese Cake and a cup of hot Oolong tea. The cake was just stunning, not too sweet, creamy and rich of fresh quality durian - far beyond my expectation.\n\nThe tea was also great. The atmosphere was quite cozy and very well, aesthetically decorated as one of the shared owners of the shop is an painting artist. \n\nThis place is highly recommended!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 28, 2019",
            "rating": 3.0,
