            "review_title": "Review at Camellia - Flower, Tea & Cake",
            "review_text": "Alexey Vronsky\n4 contributions\n1\nA must-try cafe\nMay 2019 • Couples\nA very nice place. I accidentally passed by the road where the store is located. Trying a cup of black tea and a cheese cake flavoured with blueberry when the outside was so hot. They were all wonderful. Their taste were beyond my expectations. \n\nBesides, the store also had some little flowers. I also try a cup of coffee with condensed milk then. A good coffee.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 31, 2019",
