            "review_title": "Review at Camellia - Flower, Tea & Cake",
            "review_text": "Anthony Nguyen\n4 contributions\n2\nA MUST check out place in town!\nMay 2019 • Friends\nI visited this place few days ago during its grand opening week. The location is good, very close to the train station. Nguyen Du street, where the shop locates, is a clean and not so crowed area.\n\nFirst impression was the cozy atmosphere, very well and asthetically decorated.\n\nI ordered a local drink - Iced tea with peach, orange and lemon grass and was totally blown away.\n\nNormally I do not eat cake as I need to control sugar intake but the cakes here literaly caught my eyes. I tried the shop's signatute - Camellia Peach Mousse, OMG this was the best cake ever, every bite worth!!!\n\nI will definitely come back to this place.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 18, 2019",
